    "provenance": "Package A is the six slots the app has always had, written down. Package C is Leo's round-16 note: 30\" freestanding range, 30\" chimney hood, 36\" freestanding counter-depth refrigerator standing at the end of a run, 24\" dishwasher, microwave drawer and wine cabinet. Package B is registered so its id and its place in the tier order are fixed; its slots are Leo's to write. The defaultSelection for C is picked from the catalogue by category, width and install type and is a stand-in until Leo supplies the models — every one of them is a real record in data/appliances.json, none is invented. Package B is Leo's round-20 note: a 36\" gas rangetop under a custom hood cabinet with a VCIN36GWS insert liner in it, and three tall units in one run — the built-in refrigerator outermost, an 18\" wine column beside it and a 30\" combination oven inside them. Its microwave slot carries a wall oven and its wine slot a column, so neither migrates to or from A and C's drawer and cooler; the island, if there is one, is a prep island with no appliance in it."
